{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Nightmare Kitchen: Welcome to the Greasepunk Apocalypse</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Story So Far</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3077140/extras/fffb6f8fd8035735c6db77adf153dae9.poster.avif?t=1773037530\" width=720 height=576 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3077140/extras/fffb6f8fd8035735c6db77adf153dae9.webm?t=1773037530\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3077140/extras/fffb6f8fd8035735c6db77adf153dae9.mp4?t=1773037530\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Tater Hills Mall, the proud home of Spudnik Biosystems, creators of the nutritional wonder-ingredient &quot;Cholesterite.&quot; Once hailed as a miracle, Cholesterite's side effects are now clear: an insatiable, demented army of mutant food bent on devouring humanity. Unfortunately, you're on today's menu.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as chefs from the mall's abandoned food court who find themselves strangely mutated and uniquely suited to fight back. Join other survivors trapped in this neon-lit nightmare, alone or in Co-Op with up to four players, as you battle to escape the cursed culinary apocalypse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Food-Fueled Foes:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3077140/extras/73e379c12f1fed0fab14ca5bd096b6da.poster.avif?t=1773037530\" width=720 height=576 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3077140/extras/73e379c12f1fed0fab14ca5bd096b6da.webm?t=1773037530\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3077140/extras/73e379c12f1fed0fab14ca5bd096b6da.mp4?t=1773037530\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Face twisted, unsettling, and grotesque food monsters, each with  diabolical behaviors and attacks. Take on monstrous bosses like killer tacos, rabid salads, and vengeful desserts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Procedurally Delicious Dungeons:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3077140/extras/351f9c07942a5638bc1416994011fa17.poster.avif?t=1773037530\" width=720 height=576 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3077140/extras/351f9c07942a5638bc1416994011fa17.webm?t=1773037530\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3077140/extras/351f9c07942a5638bc1416994011fa17.mp4?t=1773037530\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Explore ever-changing layouts filled with deadly traps, challenging puzzles, and environments themed around American, Mexican, Asian, Dessert, and Health food.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Absurd Culinary Arsenal:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3077140/extras/ecb6d94a148bd052197096e92daa27dd.poster.avif?t=1773037530\" width=720 height=576 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3077140/extras/ecb6d94a148bd052197096e92daa27dd.webm?t=1773037530\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3077140/extras/ecb6d94a148bd052197096e92daa27dd.mp4?t=1773037530\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Craft and wield  bizarre weapon combinations. Load your guns with  distinct food-based ammo types, each creating wild combat and environmental effects. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Loot A La Carte:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3077140/extras/7683c82b219de046252e526d76b2e069.poster.avif?t=1773037530\" width=720 height=576 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3077140/extras/7683c82b219de046252e526d76b2e069.webm?t=1773037530\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3077140/extras/7683c82b219de046252e526d76b2e069.mp4?t=1773037530\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> <br>Gather mountains of weird and powerful loot. Boost your chef's stats to gain an edge against your culinary nightmares.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Roguelite Replayability:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3077140/extras/b1fbcdca7de3334dc59647b4351e4382.poster.avif?t=1773037530\" width=720 height=576 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3077140/extras/b1fbcdca7de3334dc59647b4351e4382.webm?t=1773037530\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3077140/extras/b1fbcdca7de3334dc59647b4351e4382.mp4?t=1773037530\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Death comes at a cost: you'll drop loot, weapons, and temporary upgrades. But don't worry because permanent upgrades, story progress, and hidden secrets carry over, ensuring every run feels rewarding and unique.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>4-Player Co-Op Chaos:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3077140/extras/fcd3f34abf7a4cf23bb35fe0aa236cac.poster.avif?t=1773037530\" width=720 height=576 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3077140/extras/fcd3f34abf7a4cf23bb35fe0aa236cac.webm?t=1773037530\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3077140/extras/fcd3f34abf7a4cf23bb35fe0aa236cac.mp4?t=1773037530\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Team up with friends online to tackle the mall\u2019s greasy horrors. Survive, fight, and laugh through the madness together\u2014because everything\u2019s better with friends, even the apocalypse.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3077140?t=1773037530","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3077140/1d99abd153698ad437dd1d341aac9c409f078506/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1773037530","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3077140/818dfbf0d2d5cbcb4f35919ef4fe373f1e13d473/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773037530","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3077140/818dfbf0d2d5cbcb4f35919ef4fe373f1e13d473/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773037530","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],