ster.avif?t=1773037530\" width=720 height=576 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3077140/extras/73e379c12f1fed0fab14ca5bd096b6da.webm?t=1773037530\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3077140/extras/73e379c12f1fed0fab14ca5bd096b6da.mp4?t=1773037530\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Face twisted, unsettling, and grotesque food monsters, each with  diabolical behaviors and attacks. Take on monstrous bosses like killer tacos, rabid salads, and vengeful desserts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Procedurally Delicious Dungeons:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3077140/extras/351f9c07942a5638bc1416994011fa17.poster.avif?t=1773037530\" width=720 height=576 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3077140/extras/351f9c07942a5638bc1416994011fa17.webm?t=1773037530\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3077140/extras/351f9c07942a5638bc1416994011fa17.mp4?t=1773037530\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Explore ever-changing layouts filled with deadly traps, challenging puzzles, and environments themed around American, Mexican, Asian, Dessert, and Health food.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Absurd Culinary Arsenal:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3077140/extras/ecb6d94a148bd052197096e92daa27dd.poster.avif?t=1773037530\" width=720 height=576 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3077140/extras/ecb6d94a148bd052197096e92daa27dd.webm?t=1773037530\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3077140/extras/ecb6d94a148bd052197096e92daa27dd.mp4?t=1773037530\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Craft and wield  bizarre weapon combinations. Load your guns with  distinct food-based ammo types, each creating wild combat and environmental effects. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Loot A La Carte:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3077140/extras/7683c82b219de046252e526d76b2e069.poster.avif?t=1773037530\" width=720 height=576 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3077140/extras/7683c82b219de046252e526d76b2e069.webm?t=1773037530\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3077140/extras/7683c82b219de046252e526d76b2e069.mp4?t=1773037530\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> <br>Gather mountains of weird and powerful loot. Boost your chef's stats to gain an edge against your culinary nightmares.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Roguelite Replayability:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3077140/extras/b1fbcdca7de3334dc59647b4351e4382.poster.avif?t=1773037530\" width=720 height=576 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3077140/extras/b1fbcdca7de3334dc59647b4351e4382.webm?t=1773037530\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3077140/extras/b1fbcdca7de3334dc59647b4351e4382.mp4?t=1773037530\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Death comes at a cost: you'll drop loot, weapons, and temporary upgrades. But don't worry because permanent upgrades, story progress, and hidden secrets carry over, ensuring every run feels rewarding and unique.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>4-Player Co-Op Chaos:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3077140/extras/fcd3f34abf7a4cf23bb35fe0aa236cac.poster.avif?t=1773037530\" width=720 height=576 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3077140/extras/fcd3f34abf7a4cf23bb35fe0aa236cac.webm?t=1773037530\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3077140/extras/fcd3f34abf7a4cf23bb35fe0aa236cac.mp4?t=1773037530\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Team up with friends online to tackle the mall\u2019s greasy horrors. Survive, fight, and laugh through the madness together\u2014because everything\u2019s better with friends, even the apocalypse.</p>","developers":["Byteback Studios"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3077140/badc5ff40890aa711560c831dc15f863464c0eb8/header.jpg?t=1773037530","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9Corrtex Games, 2022-2025, All Rights Reserved","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3077140/2045167248/3b7b17a2851bf37ce5b2adbe9a43220bfeff1df3/1773034717/dash_av1.mpd?t=1773037529","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3077140/2045167248/3b7b17a2851bf37ce5b2adbe9a43220bfeff1df3/1773034717/dash_h264.mpd?t=1773037529","highlight":tru